{"name":"小吊梨汤·北京菜·烤鸭(豫园店)","match_restaurant_id":1057,"brand_group":"小吊梨汤","brand_confirmed":true,"cuisine_paths":[["中餐","京菜","胡同家常"]],"form":"Casual Dining","meals":["午餐","晚餐"],"ingredients":["肉禽","饮品"],"awards":{"michelin":"无","black_pearl":0,"source_url":null},"special_tags":["可预订","包间"],"price_avg":100,"price_range":"¥80-150","price_sources":[{"platform":"携程","value":100,"url":"https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=356151496"}],"district":"黄浦区","address":"豫园百货3楼","business_area":"豫园","lat":null,"lng":null,"coord_source":null,"phone_raw":null,"booking_method":"大众点评","signature_dishes":["金奖茉莉烤鸭","小吊梨汤","燕窝梨汤","北京爆肚","炸酱面","山楂条卷饼"],"status":"open","scores":{"objective":82,"diner":85,"taste":83,"endorsement":70,"soft_ad_penalty":3,"platform_credibility":0.9},"evidence":{"diner_quotes":[{"quote":"招牌金奖茉莉烤鸭趁热品尝，小吊首创茶窨工艺，制烤时将茉莉花香放进鸭腹里窨制。琥珀色鸭皮薄脆酥化，山楂条京葱与黄瓜，花香肉香酸甜层次交织完全不腻。","dish":"茉莉烤鸭","source":"携程笔记","url":"https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=337537453","date":"2026-07-15"},{"quote":"梨汤每天凌晨4点开炉猛火现熬6小时，梨汤熬得绵密胶质清甜润喉。茉莉烤鸭鸭皮酥脆化渣，鸭肉带淡淡茉莉茶香好吃不腻口。","dish":"小吊梨汤","source":"携程笔记","url":"https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=360364411","date":"2026-08-21"}],"platform_scores":[{"platform":"携程","score":4.6,"review_count":500,"url":"https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=356151496"}],"negative_signals":["豫园旅游区游客多","露台位旺季难订"],"soft_ad_flags":["连续7年必吃榜品牌效应"],"traffic_signals":["豫园景区客流大","必吃榜连续上榜","露台夜景打卡"]},"sources":[{"title":"携程笔记-豫园露台国风京菜馆","url":"https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=356151496","type":"ugc"},{"title":"携程笔记-谁懂烤鸭配梨汤才是灵魂","url":"https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=337537453","type":"ugc"},{"title":"抖音-小吊梨汤年夜饭","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7601385599094202054","type":"ugc"}],"data_updated_at":"2026-09-23","notes":"库内id=1057补强。小吊梨汤豫园店，连续7年必吃榜。茉莉烤鸭获中国烹饪协会金奖。梨汤每日现熬6小时。"}
